      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果约定当 $D=0$ 时，把二次方程看作有两个相等的根，",
        "那么可以把上面的结论推广到任何有根的二次方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样就得到下面的定理："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**二次方程 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 两根的和等于 $-\\frac{b}{a}$，而两根的**",
        "**积等于 $\\frac{c}{a}$.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个定理叫做**韦达定理**，得名于著名的法国数学家弗兰",
        "苏阿·韦达（1540－1603）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于简化的二次方程来说，它的根与系数之间的关系具",
        "有比较简单的形式。事实上，如果在有根方程 $ax^2+bx+c=0$",
        "里，系数 $a=1$，那么两根的和等于 $-b$，而两根的积等于 $c$，就",
        "是说：**简化的二次方程两根的和等于第二个系数，但取相反的**",
        "**符号，而两根的积等于常数项。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举例说，我们来看方程",
        "$x^2-7x+10=0$.",
        "因为判别式是正的（$D=(-7)^2-4\\times10=9$），所以方程有两",
        "个根。设 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 是方程的根。根据韦达定理，$x_1+x_2=7$，",
        "$x_1x_2=10$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "韦达定理的逆定理也成立："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**如果两个数 $m$ 与 $n$ 的和等于 $-\\frac{b}{a}$，而它们的积等于 $\\frac{c}{a}$，**",
        "**那么这两个数就是二次方程 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的根。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "269"
      ]
    }
  ]
